<title>POLAND: Wolczanka Q1 net flat at PLN 1.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Wolczanka Q1 net flat at PLN 1.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wolczanka preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.55   vs    2.68</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 2.93   vs    3.25</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.65   vs    1.65</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     23.13   vs   22.41</p>
<p>    costs of sales			15.28   vs   14.79</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.01   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.27   vs    1.60</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.49   vs    0.67</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.12   vs    0.11</p>
<p>    investment			     0.42   vs    0.64</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
